## Process lessons worth keeping

- **Commit planning docs BEFORE re-running verification.** `REQUIREMENTS.md` and `*-UAT.md` are
  inside a verification's own `covered_files`, so fixing any advisory a verification raises stales
  that verification. Three of phase 17's five verification passes existed only because of this.
- **Always diff GSD tool writes.** `phase.complete` reported success but wrote
  `completed_phases: 3` of 4 (75%) when all four phases were `[x]`; corrected to 4/4 in `33e0ce4`.
  A `frontmatter.set`-style string replace also corrupted a `17-VALIDATION.md` comment that
  happened to contain the literal target string while leaving the real field untouched.
- **Run the FULL test suite before calling a fix verified.** The CR-01 gate broke three
  `DriftReportTest` date-filter tests (fixture defaulted to `SchedulingMode.SLOT`); the fixer, the
  re-reviewer and I all ran only targeted classes and missed it. Full suite: ~14 min, 0 failures.

